&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Wheely&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wheely is redefining premium transportation across major cities in Europe, the US, and the Middle East. We blend cutting-edge technology with the craft of five-star chauffeuring to deliver an experience trusted by more than 100,000 active riders and 1,200 corporate accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a profitable, fast-growing scale-up with $43M raised and over $100M in annual revenue. Having recently launched in New York City, we’re expanding rapidly across the US and EMEA. If you take pride in your craft and want to help shape the next chapter of our growth, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
We&#39;re hiring Associate Data Scientists with a background in Operations Research. You will own the entire process: from ideation and research through to production deployment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You&#39;ll join either our Pricing or Matching team, working alongside other Data Scientists and engineers on challenging, high-impact problems such as dynamic pricing and bipartite matching.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineers, Data Scientists, designers, and product managers to solve ambiguous problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research, prototype, and ship ML and optimisation models into production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve existing algorithms and identify opportunities for new ones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master&#39;s or PhD in Operations Research, Mathematics, Management Science or a closely related field with a focus on optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundation in mathematical optimisation or mathematical programming&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of probability &amp;amp; statistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of Reinforcement Learning and Casual Inference&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent programming skills in Python and core ML tooling (e.g. SQL,&amp;nbsp;PyTorch, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice To Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to dynamic pricing, auction design, or marketplace matching problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Publication in Q1/A* journals, participation in NeurIPS and other conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Office-based role in West London, four days a week with flexible start and finish times, plus one remote day of your choice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: £50,000 – £70,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee stock options plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical and dental insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and critical illness cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Latest-generation MacBook Pro and 4k display&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly credit towards Wheely journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;All of your personal information will be collected stored and processed in accordance with&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://wheely.com/en/legal/uk/for-candidates/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wheely’s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Optiver is looking for a Software Engineer to join our Digital Assets Team in London. In this role, you’ll build and evolve trading systems for cryptocurrency markets, working closely with traders and researchers to deliver solutions in a fast-moving and constantly changing environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll play a key role in building out our digital assets platform, helping shape both the technology and engineering practices from the ground up. You’ll work side-by-side with traders and researchers, iterating quickly on ideas and translating market insights into production systems. From integrating with major centralised exchanges to improving system reliability in real-world conditions, your work will directly impact how we trade in this rapidly growing space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build trading systems for digital asset markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage connectivity to centralised exchanges such as Binance, Deribit, and OKX&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with traders and researchers to prototype and iterate on trading strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve system reliability through automation, monitoring, and robust recovery mechanisms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot issues across trading systems and exchange integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to architecture and help shape the digital assets platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of production systems and drive continuous improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building high-performance, reliable systems ideally involving exchange connectivity, market data, trading infrastructure or other real-time applications - experience with cryptocurrency exchanges, trading protocols or digital asset markets would be desirable.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid understanding of software architecture, networking, distributed systems and failure handling.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Beneficial to have C++ development skills, with experience building reliable production systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Beneficial to have hands-on experience integrating with centralised cryptocurrency exchanges (e.g., Binance, Deribit, OKX)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Beneficial to have experience working with cloud technologies (e.g., AWS, GCP, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and an interest in tackling complex technical challenges in fast-paced environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset with the ability to take ownership and partner closely with traders and researchers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to translate ambiguous trading requirements into practical engineering solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership-driven mindset with a focus on building resilient systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Optiver, our mission is to continuously improve the market. By providing liquidity and accurate pricing in various financial instruments, to multiple exchanges across the world, we participate in the safeguarding of healthy and efficient markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a culture of collaboration and excellence, where you’ll be surrounded by curious thinkers and creative problem solvers. Motivated by a passion for continuous improvement, you’ll thrive in a supportive, high-performing environment alongside talented colleagues, working collectively to tackle the toughest problems in the financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, you’ll receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A performance-based bonus structure, enabling all of our employees to benefit from our global profit pool.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27 paid vacation days plus all UK public holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily breakfast and lunch, along with support on commuting expenses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance, pension scheme, and ClassPass fitness membership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training and continuous learning opportunities, including access to conferences and tech events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International transfer opportunities for global career growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply directly via the form below. If you have any questions feel free to contact our Recruitment team via -----
&lt;p&gt;Please note:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We do not require any assistance from third-parties including agencies in the recruitment of this role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We cannot accept applications via email&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Optiver is committed to &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/diversity-statement/?_gl=1*bh82o8*_up*MQ..&amp;amp;gclid=EAIaIQobChMItNH9v-THiQMVyJZQBh1Kbw3YEAAYASABEgI0z_D_BwE&quot;&gt;diversity and inclusion&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
