&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Hudl, we build great teams. We hire the best of the best to ensure you’re working with people you can constantly learn from. You’re trusted to get your work done your way while testing the limits of what’s possible and what’s next. We work hard to provide a culture where everyone feels supported, and our employees feel it—their votes helped us become one of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/blog/hudl-2026-top-100-inspiring-workplaces?utm_medium=internal&amp;amp;utm_source=job-ad&amp;amp;utm_campaign=26_NA_talent_job-ad&amp;amp;utm_content=1org_learn-more_blog-link_learn-more_2blog_organic_3ctw&quot;&gt;Top 100 Inspiring Workplaces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We think of ourselves as the team behind the team, supporting the lifelong impact sports can have: the lessons in teamwork and dedication; the influence of inspiring coaches; and the opportunities to reach new heights. That’s why we help teams from all over the world see their game differently. Our products make it easier for coaches and athletes at any level to capture video, analyze data, share highlights and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to join us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://player.vimeo.com/video/1095624224?h=9e8cdc9dbe&amp;amp;badge=0&amp;amp;autopause=0&amp;amp;player_id=0&amp;amp;app_id=58479&quot; width=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Your Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Senior Software Engineer to join our Core Data team in London.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This team builds the systems that power how Hudl understands sport at scale. From identifying players and teams across thousands of leagues to processing the moments that become highlights, stats and analysis, our services sit at the center of Hudl&#39;s platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Engineer, you&#39;ll help shape the technical direction of the Global Sports Library (GSL), the backbone that connects identities, metadata and game context across Hudl products. You&#39;ll design and evolve APIs, distributed systems and large-scale data pipelines that ensure Hudl products operate from a consistent understanding of the game.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is deeply backend-focused and comes with significant ownership. You&#39;ll tackle complex engineering challenges around scalability, entity resolution, data consistency and platform architecture, while helping raise the technical bar across the team through design leadership, mentoring and pragmatic decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The systems you build won&#39;t support just one product or one sport. They&#39;ll become shared capabilities used across Hudl&#39;s ecosystem, powering experiences for teams, athletes and fans around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a key technical leader.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll support the team by breaking down complex engineering problems, advocating for best practices and guiding others in addition to your focus on delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain efficiency.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll ensure your team delivers high-impact work efficiently by focusing on outcomes over outputs. Your leadership will empower the team to make data-driven decisions and iterate quickly on feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across disciplines.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll work closely with leaders from various disciplines to plan and deliver enhancements across our product suite. Your ability to integrate diverse perspectives will be key to driving innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foster Agile practices.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll participate actively in Scrum ceremonies and play a significant role in maintaining a strong team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Time spent collaborating with your teammates in-office will be a regular part of how you work. We&#39;re currently considering applicants within commuting distance of London. You&#39;ll be expected to work more days in-office than remote, but will have the freedom to coordinate your specific in-office schedule with your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong technical proficiency.&lt;/strong&gt; You have extensive experience in full-stack engineering and have spent time with cloud-based systems and services. You&#39;re also an advocate of TDD and CI/CD.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical coaching experience.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re comfortable translating requirements, creating architectural proposals and guiding other engineers through implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A collaborative, team-first mindset.&lt;/strong&gt; You know building excellent software is a team effort and you&#39;re willing to pitch in whenever a teammate needs a hand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor mentality.&lt;/strong&gt; You believe in the multiplier mindset and enjoy helping fellow engineers hone their skills through code reviews and pair programming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech stack knowledge.&lt;/strong&gt; Professional background in C#, GraphQL, Elastic, MongoDB and AWS is ideal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience with media at scale.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve worked with video encoding and on-demand rendering in a professional setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passion for sports.&lt;/strong&gt; You have an interest in the sports world and an understanding of sports analytics is a definite plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Familiarity with hybrid teams.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve worked with hybrid or remote teams before and can adapt quickly to our working environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time above any required statutory leave, company-wide holidays, remote work options and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too. Plus, every five years, we give you a paid sabbatical to unplug and recharge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy.&lt;/strong&gt; We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you&#39;ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We&#39;ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;ve invested in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you&#39;re at the office or working remotely, we&#39;ll provide you the tech you need to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your wellbeing.&lt;/strong&gt; Depending on location, we offer medical and retirement benefits for employees—but no matter where you&#39;re located, we have resources like our Employee Assistance Program and employee resource groups to support your mental health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is displayed below—&lt;strong&gt;starting salaries will typically fall near the middle of this range.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make compensation decisions based on an individual&#39;s experience, skills and education in line with our internal pay equity practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will also be eligible for a long-term incentive (LTI) award. Any bonuses awarded are based on individual and company performance paid at Hudl&#39;s discretion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£66,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£111,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
