&lt;p&gt;Time spent collaborating with your teammates in-office will be a regular part of how you work. We&#39;re currently considering applicants within commuting distance of London. You&#39;ll be expected to work more days in-office than remote, but will have&amp;nbsp; the freedom to coordinate your specific in-office schedule with your team. We&#39;re also open to remote candidates in the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
