&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced. &lt;/strong&gt;You have either led or played a key role in developing large-scale applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A team player&lt;/strong&gt;. You understand that problem-solving is a team effort and will help others on our Engineering team learn and develop their skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User-focused&lt;/strong&gt;. You&#39;re excited to have your work used by real people to solve real problems.&lt;/li&gt;
